    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this 2 bedroom first floor apartment to the market for sale. \n\nHaving been freshly painted throughout, this property comes to the market in immaculate condition having been well maintained by its current owners. Offering ample bright airy and spacious living accommodation, the property comprises of entrance hallway, kitchen, living room, family bathroom and two bedrooms, the main of which is ensuite. To the side and rear are the large common green areas ideal for recreational facilities. \n\nSituated within a private and secure gated complex, this apartment is within walking distance to all local amenities that Newbridge has to offer including primary and secondary schools, creches, leading supermarket chains, bars, restaurants, chemists, Whitewater Shopping Centre, Newbridge Silverware and much more. The town benefits from a regular bus and train timetable. Access to the M7/N7 motorway is c.8 minute drive away making it ideal for any commuter. \n\nViewing of this property comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, shoe cabinet\n\nKitchen: Tiled flooring, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge freezer, microwave, combi washer dryer machine\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, feature electric fireplace and media wall, soundbar, built in storage units and shelving \n\nBedroom 1: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe, chest of drawers, mirror\n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, electric shower, WHB, WC, mirrored storage cabinet, heated towel rail \n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, fitted wardrobe, drawers \n\nFamily Bathroom: Lino flooring, tiled surround, bath, WHB, WC \n\nFeatures:\n\nManagement fees approx. 2,000 per annum\nOne (X1) designated parking spot with EV charger\nSelected carpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings included \nHardwood communal door\nPVC double glazed windows\nIntercom system\nElectric smart radiators\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 1996\nc.58sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
